{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mid-1900's insane asylum, <strong>Mindbreak</strong> is a thrilling story of an attempted escape. Use your puzzle solving skills along with the unique abilities of each character to navigate the vast asylum and disrupt the Warden\u2019s malevolent scheme. Combining tile-based puzzle solving with the thrill of exploration and ability building, <strong>Mindbreak</strong> is sure to leave you both puzzled and intrigued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/7dc89a38b67a961f91e50ecf5c43d670.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1024 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s the ability to teleport or to temporarily enter a separate dimension, the different characters are not only equipped with unique personalities. As you venture further to unlock your characters, more powerful abilities are needed to advance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/ebeef3ef75b47ecfd014baa6c262de2b.poster.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/ebeef3ef75b47ecfd014baa6c262de2b.webm?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/ebeef3ef75b47ecfd014baa6c262de2b.mp4?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/39f83e888d8dde8da1ac9bbe4659db2e.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1024 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are primarily made by color coded tiles. Each character matches a color and can only walk along tiles of that color. Black is impassable to all, while white can be used by anyone. Players use the unique abilities of the characters, to help them navigate the puzzles and master the vast interconnected asylum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/5c63da14de60bdae4d5b0b6f4f7a5a9d.poster.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/5c63da14de60bdae4d5b0b6f4f7a5a9d.webm?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/5c63da14de60bdae4d5b0b6f4f7a5a9d.mp4?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/fff02d4fe0f239fe73436130910f41bd.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1024 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Guards are always patrolling the corridors, and the greatest advances are often guarded by more powerful enemies with supernatural abilities of their own. It is encounters such as these that truly test the skill and knowledge of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470490?t=1771326432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/69f51d7a42b64ff28e182ed486998bc44f16963c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771326432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/f5d42db5db5f352e27c1ce52a75d9087164d1d9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771326432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/f5d42db5db5f352e27c1ce52a75d9087164d1d9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771326432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game explores themes of mental illness, featuring characters who are patients in an insane asylum. While there is no graphic violence, combat, or gore, the story contains psychologically intense and potentially disturbing content.\r\n\r\nMental health is depicted in both darkly humorous and unsettling ways, and the setting involves elements of confinement, delusion, and trauma. Players may encounter scenes or dialogue that reflect disordered thinking, hallucinations, or emotionally charged situations.\r\n\r\nThe game does not include depictions of sexual acts, sexual violence, or substance abuse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a mid-1900's insane asylum, <strong>Mindbreak</strong> is a thrilling story of an attempted escape. Use your puzzle solving skills along with the unique abilities of each character to navigate the vast asylum and disrupt the Warden\u2019s malevolent scheme. Combining tile-based puzzle solving with the thrill of exploration and ability building, <strong>Mindbreak</strong> is sure to leave you both puzzled and intrigued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/7dc89a38b67a961f91e50ecf5c43d670.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1024 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s the ability to teleport or to temporarily enter a separate dimension, the different characters are not only equipped with unique personalities. As you venture further to unlock your characters, more powerful abilities are needed to advance.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/ebeef3ef75b47ecfd014baa6c262de2b.poster.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/ebeef3ef75b47ecfd014baa6c262de2b.webm?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/ebeef3ef75b47ecfd014baa6c262de2b.mp4?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/39f83e888d8dde8da1ac9bbe4659db2e.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1024 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are primarily made by color coded tiles. Each character matches a color and can only walk along tiles of that color. Black is impassable to all, while white can be used by anyone. Players use the unique abilities of the characters, to help them navigate the puzzles and master the vast interconnected asylum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/5c63da14de60bdae4d5b0b6f4f7a5a9d.poster.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/5c63da14de60bdae4d5b0b6f4f7a5a9d.webm?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/5c63da14de60bdae4d5b0b6f4f7a5a9d.mp4?t=1771326432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/extras/fff02d4fe0f239fe73436130910f41bd.avif?t=1771326432\" width=1024 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out! Guards are always patrolling the corridors, and the greatest advances are often guarded by more powerful enemies with supernatural abilities of their own. It is encounters such as these that truly test the skill and knowledge of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lost Umbrella Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470490/415eff354b20333663319145c5bff1410661438a/header.jpg?t=1771326432","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470490/1472878225/051409c5ffca1b2d08be8cafeaeaee4c03d58fd8/1750853916/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771326431","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470490/1472878225/051409c5ffca1b2d08be8cafeaeaee4c03d58fd8/1750853916/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771326431","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470490/1472878225/051409c5ffca1b2d08be8cafeaeaee4c03d58fd8/1750853916/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771326431","id":257137707,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://sha