nsane asylum. Play as the supernaturally gifted asylum patients as you build and combine their unique abilities to explore and master the vast interconnected asylum.","steam_appid":3470490,"support_info":{"email":"contact@lostumbrellagames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://lostumbrellagames.com/mindbreak"}